404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 295 0 R
/T (You can look at online sales as divided roughly into two groups: small-ticket and big- ticket items. Big-ticket items include computer equipment and consumer electronics, where orders can easily be more than $1,000. Small-ticket items include apparel, books, health and beauty supplies, office supplies, music, software, videos, and toys, where the average purchase is typically less than $100. )
/E (You can look at online sales as divided roughly into two groups: small-ticket and big- ticket items. Big-ticket items include computer equipment and consumer electronics, where orders can easily be more than $1,000. Small-ticket items include apparel, books, health and beauty supplies, office supplies, music, software, videos, and toys, where the average purchase is typically less than $100. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 295 0 R
/T (In the early days of e-commerce, sales of small-ticket items vastly outnumbered those of large-ticket items. But the recent growth of big-ticket items such as computer hardware, consumer electronics, furniture, and jewelry has changed the overall sales mix. Consumers are now much more confident spending online for big-ticket items. )
/E (In the early days of e-commerce, sales of small-ticket items vastly outnumbered those of large-ticket items. But the recent growth of big-ticket items such as computer hardware, consumer electronics, furniture, and jewelry has changed the overall sales mix. Consumers are now much more confident spending online for big-ticket items. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 295 0 R
/T (Although furniture and large appliances were ini- tially perceived as too bulky to sell online, these categories have rapidly expanded in the last few years. )
/E (Although furniture and large appliances were ini- tially perceived as too bulky to sell online, these categories have rapidly expanded in the last few years. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
