/Title (Social networks offer advertisers all the main advertising formats, including ban- ner ads, native advertising, short pre-roll and post-roll ads associated with videos, and sponsorship of content. Having a corporate Facebook page is in itself a marketing tool for brands just like a web page. Many firms, such as Coca-Cola, have shut down product- specific web pages and instead use Facebook pages.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2190 0 R
/Prev 2198 0 R
>>
endobj
